{
  "snp3.11:0.1": "",
  "snp3.11:0.2": "684. 11. Nālakasuttaṃ ",
  "snp3.11:1.1": "Ānandajāte tidasagaṇe patīte, ",
  "snp3.11:1.2": "sakkañca indaṃ sucivasane ca deve; ",
  "snp3.11:1.3": "Dussaṃ gahetvā atiriva thomayante, ",
  "snp3.11:1.4": "asito isi addasa divāvihāre. ",
  "snp3.11:2.1": "685. Disvāna deve muditamane udagge, ",
  "snp3.11:2.2": "cittiṃ karitvāna idamavoca tattha; ",
  "snp3.11:2.3": "‘‘Kiṃ devasaṅgho atiriva kalyarūpo, ",
  "snp3.11:2.4": "dussaṃ gahetvā ramayatha kiṃ paṭicca. ",
  "snp3.11:3.1": "686. ‘‘Yadāpi āsī asurehi saṅgamo, ",
  "snp3.11:3.2": "jayo surānaṃ asurā parājitā. ",
  "snp3.11:3.3": "Tadāpi netādiso lomahaṃsano, ",
  "snp3.11:3.4": "kimabbhutaṃ daṭṭhu marū pamoditā. ",
  "snp3.11:4.1": "687. ‘‘Seḷenti gāyanti ca vādayanti ca, ",
  "snp3.11:4.2": "bhujāni phoṭenti ca naccayanti ca; ",
  "snp3.11:4.3": "Pucchāmi vohaṃ merumuddhavāsine, ",
  "snp3.11:4.4": "dhunātha me saṃsayaṃ khippa mārisā’’. ",
  "snp3.11:5.1": "688. ‘‘So bodhisatto ratanavaro atulyo, ",
  "snp3.11:5.2": "manussaloke hitasukhatthāya jāto; ",
  "snp3.11:5.3": "Sakyāna gāme janapade lumbineyye, ",
  "snp3.11:5.4": "tenamha tuṭṭhā atiriva kalyarūpā. ",
  "snp3.11:6.1": "689. ‘‘So sabbasattuttamo aggapuggalo, ",
  "snp3.11:6.2": "narāsabho sabbapajānamuttamo; ",
  "snp3.11:6.3": "Vattessati cakkamisivhaye vane, ",
  "snp3.11:6.4": "nadaṃva sīho balavā migābhibhū’’. ",
  "snp3.11:7.1": "690. Taṃ saddaṃ sutvā turitamavasarī so, ",
  "snp3.11:7.2": "suddhodanassa tada bhavanaṃ upāvisi ; ",
  "snp3.11:7.3": "Nisajja tattha idamavocāsi sakye, ",
  "snp3.11:7.4": "‘‘kuhiṃ kumāro ahamapi daṭṭhukāmo’’. ",
  "snp3.11:8.1": "691. Tato kumāraṃ jalitamiva suvaṇṇaṃ, ",
  "snp3.11:8.2": "ukkāmukheva sukusalasampahaṭṭhaṃ ; ",
  "snp3.11:8.3": "Daddallamānaṃ siriyā anomavaṇṇaṃ, ",
  "snp3.11:8.4": "dassesu puttaṃ asitavhayassa sakyā. ",
  "snp3.11:9.1": "692. Disvā kumāraṃ sikhimiva pajjalantaṃ, ",
  "snp3.11:9.2": "tārāsabhaṃva nabhasigamaṃ visuddhaṃ; ",
  "snp3.11:9.3": "Sūriyaṃ tapantaṃ saradarivabbhamuttaṃ, ",
  "snp3.11:9.4": "ānandajāto vipulamalattha pītiṃ. ",
  "snp3.11:10.1": "693. Anekasākhañca sahassamaṇḍalaṃ, ",
  "snp3.11:10.2": "chattaṃ marū dhārayumantalikkhe; ",
  "snp3.11:10.3": "Suvaṇṇadaṇḍā vītipatanti cāmarā, ",
  "snp3.11:10.4": "na dissare cāmarachattagāhakā. ",
  "snp3.11:11.1": "694. Disvā jaṭī kaṇhasirivhayo isi, ",
  "snp3.11:11.2": "suvaṇṇanikkhaṃ viya paṇḍukambale; ",
  "snp3.11:11.3": "Setañca chattaṃ dhariyanta muddhani, ",
  "snp3.11:11.4": "udaggacitto sumano paṭiggahe. ",
  "snp3.11:12.1": "695. Paṭiggahetvā pana sakyapuṅgavaṃ, ",
  "snp3.11:12.2": "jigīsato lakkhaṇamantapāragū; ",
  "snp3.11:12.3": "Pasannacitto giramabbhudīrayi, ",
  "snp3.11:12.4": "‘‘anuttarāyaṃ dvipadānamuttamo’’ . ",
  "snp3.11:13.1": "696. Athattano gamanamanussaranto, ",
  "snp3.11:13.2": "akalyarūpo gaḷayati assukāni; ",
  "snp3.11:13.3": "Disvāna sakyā isimavocuṃ rudantaṃ, ",
  "snp3.11:13.4": "‘‘No ce kumāre bhavissati antarāyo’’. ",
  "snp3.11:14.1": "697. Disvāna sakye isimavoca akalye, ",
  "snp3.11:14.2": "‘‘nāhaṃ kumāre ahitamanussarāmi; ",
  "snp3.11:14.3": "Na cāpimassa bhavissati antarāyo, ",
  "snp3.11:14.4": "na orakāyaṃ adhimānasā bhavātha. ",
  "snp3.11:15.1": "698. ‘‘Sambodhiyaggaṃ phusissatāyaṃ kumāro, ",
  "snp3.11:15.2": "so dhammacakkaṃ paramavisuddhadassī; ",
  "snp3.11:15.3": "Vattessatāyaṃ bahujanahitānukampī, ",
  "snp3.11:15.4": "vitthārikassa bhavissati brahmacariyaṃ. ",
  "snp3.11:16.1": "699. ‘‘Mamañca āyu na ciramidhāvaseso, ",
  "snp3.11:16.2": "athantarā me bhavissati kālakiriyā; ",
  "snp3.11:16.3": "Sohaṃ na sossaṃ asamadhurassa dhammaṃ, ",
  "snp3.11:16.4": "tenamhi aṭṭo byasanaṃgato aghāvī’’. ",
  "snp3.11:17.1": "700. So sākiyānaṃ vipulaṃ janetvā pītiṃ, ",
  "snp3.11:17.2": "antepuramhā niggamā brahmacārī; ",
  "snp3.11:17.3": "So bhāgineyyaṃ sayaṃ anukampamāno, ",
  "snp3.11:17.4": "samādapesi asamadhurassa dhamme. ",
  "snp3.11:18.1": "701. ‘‘Buddhoti ghosaṃ yada parato suṇāsi, ",
  "snp3.11:18.2": "sambodhipatto vivarati dhammamaggaṃ; ",
  "snp3.11:18.3": "Gantvāna tattha samayaṃ paripucchamāno , ",
  "snp3.11:18.4": "carassu tasmiṃ bhagavati brahmacariyaṃ’’. ",
  "snp3.11:19.1": "702. Tenānusiṭṭho hitamanena tādinā, ",
  "snp3.11:19.2": "anāgate paramavisuddhadassinā; ",
  "snp3.11:19.3": "So nālako upacitapuññasañcayo, ",
  "snp3.11:19.4": "jinaṃ patikkhaṃ parivasi rakkhitindriyo. ",
  "snp3.11:20.1": "703. Sutvāna ghosaṃ jinavaracakkavattane, ",
  "snp3.11:20.2": "gantvāna disvā isinisabhaṃ pasanno; ",
  "snp3.11:20.3": "Moneyyaseṭṭhaṃ munipavaraṃ apucchi, ",
  "snp3.11:20.4": "samāgate asitāvhayassa sāsaneti. ",
  "snp3.11:20.5": "Vatthugāthā niṭṭhitā. ",
  "snp3.11:21.1": "704. ‘‘Aññātametaṃ vacanaṃ, ",
  "snp3.11:21.2": "asitassa yathātathaṃ; ",
  "snp3.11:21.3": "Taṃ taṃ gotama pucchāmi, ",
  "snp3.11:21.4": "sabbadhammāna pāraguṃ. ",
  "snp3.11:22.1": "705. ‘‘Anagāriyupetassa, ",
  "snp3.11:22.2": "bhikkhācariyaṃ jigīsato; ",
  "snp3.11:22.3": "Muni pabrūhi me puṭṭho, ",
  "snp3.11:22.4": "moneyyaṃ uttamaṃ padaṃ’’. ",
  "snp3.11:23.1": "706. ‘‘Moneyyaṃ te upaññissaṃ, ",
  "snp3.11:23.2": "(iti bhagavā) ",
  "snp3.11:23.3": "dukkaraṃ durabhisambhavaṃ; ",
  "snp3.11:23.4": "Handa te naṃ pavakkhāmi, ",
  "snp3.11:23.5": "santhambhassu daḷho bhava. ",
  "snp3.11:24.1": "707. ‘‘Samānabhāgaṃ kubbetha, ",
  "snp3.11:24.2": "gāme akkuṭṭhavanditaṃ; ",
  "snp3.11:24.3": "Manopadosaṃ rakkheyya, ",
  "snp3.11:24.4": "santo anuṇṇato care. ",
  "snp3.11:25.1": "708. ‘‘Uccāvacā niccharanti, ",
  "snp3.11:25.2": "dāye aggisikhūpamā; ",
  "snp3.11:25.3": "Nāriyo muniṃ palobhenti, ",
  "snp3.11:25.4": "tāsu taṃ mā palobhayuṃ. ",
  "snp3.11:26.1": "709. ‘‘Virato methunā dhammā, ",
  "snp3.11:26.2": "hitvā kāme paropare ; ",
  "snp3.11:26.3": "Aviruddho asāratto, ",
  "snp3.11:26.4": "pāṇesu tasathāvare. ",
  "snp3.11:27.1": "710. ‘‘Yathā ahaṃ tathā ete, ",
  "snp3.11:27.2": "yathā ete tathā ahaṃ; ",
  "snp3.11:27.3": "Attānaṃ upamaṃ katvā, ",
  "snp3.11:27.4": "na haneyya na ghātaye. ",
  "snp3.11:28.1": "711. ‘‘Hitvā icchañca lobhañca, ",
  "snp3.11:28.2": "yattha satto puthujjano; ",
  "snp3.11:28.3": "Cakkhumā paṭipajjeyya, ",
  "snp3.11:28.4": "tareyya narakaṃ imaṃ. ",
  "snp3.11:29.1": "712. ‘‘Ūnūdaro mitāhāro, ",
  "snp3.11:29.2": "appicchassa alolupo; ",
  "snp3.11:29.3": "Sadā icchāya nicchāto, ",
  "snp3.11:29.4": "aniccho hoti nibbuto. ",
  "snp3.11:30.1": "713. ‘‘Sa piṇḍacāraṃ caritvā, ",
  "snp3.11:30.2": "vanantamabhihāraye; ",
  "snp3.11:30.3": "Upaṭṭhito rukkhamūlasmiṃ, ",
  "snp3.11:30.4": "āsanūpagato muni. ",
  "snp3.11:31.1": "714. ‘‘Sa jhānapasuto dhīro, ",
  "snp3.11:31.2": "vanante ramito siyā; ",
  "snp3.11:31.3": "Jhāyetha rukkhamūlasmiṃ, ",
  "snp3.11:31.4": "attānamabhitosayaṃ. ",
  "snp3.11:32.1": "715. ‘‘Tato ratyā vivasāne , ",
  "snp3.11:32.2": "gāmantamabhihāraye; ",
  "snp3.11:32.3": "Avhānaṃ nābhinandeyya, ",
  "snp3.11:32.4": "abhihārañca gāmato. ",
  "snp3.11:33.1": "716. ‘‘Na munī gāmamāgamma, ",
  "snp3.11:33.2": "kulesu sahasā care; ",
  "snp3.11:33.3": "Ghāsesanaṃ chinnakatho, ",
  "snp3.11:33.4": "na vācaṃ payutaṃ bhaṇe. ",
  "snp3.11:34.1": "717. ‘‘Alatthaṃ yadidaṃ sādhu, ",
  "snp3.11:34.2": "nālatthaṃ kusalaṃ iti; ",
  "snp3.11:34.3": "Ubhayeneva so tādī, ",
  "snp3.11:34.4": "rukkhaṃvupanivattati . ",
  "snp3.11:35.1": "718. ‘‘Sa pattapāṇi vicaranto, ",
  "snp3.11:35.2": "amūgo mūgasammato; ",
  "snp3.11:35.3": "Appaṃ dānaṃ na hīḷeyya, ",
  "snp3.11:35.4": "dātāraṃ nāvajāniyā. ",
  "snp3.11:36.1": "719. ‘‘Uccāvacā hi paṭipadā, ",
  "snp3.11:36.2": "samaṇena pakāsitā; ",
  "snp3.11:36.3": "Na pāraṃ diguṇaṃ yanti, ",
  "snp3.11:36.4": "nayidaṃ ekaguṇaṃ mutaṃ. ",
  "snp3.11:37.1": "720. ‘‘Yassa ca visatā natthi, ",
  "snp3.11:37.2": "chinnasotassa bhikkhuno; ",
  "snp3.11:37.3": "Kiccākiccappahīnassa, ",
  "snp3.11:37.4": "pariḷāho na vijjati. ",
  "snp3.11:38.1": "721. ‘‘Moneyyaṃ te upaññissaṃ, ",
  "snp3.11:38.2": "khuradhārūpamo bhave; ",
  "snp3.11:38.3": "Jivhāya tālumāhacca, ",
  "snp3.11:38.4": "udare saññato siyā. ",
  "snp3.11:39.1": "722. ‘‘Alīnacitto ca siyā, ",
  "snp3.11:39.2": "na cāpi bahu cintaye; ",
  "snp3.11:39.3": "Nirāmagandho asito, ",
  "snp3.11:39.4": "brahmacariyaparāyaṇo. ",
  "snp3.11:40.1": "723. ‘‘Ekāsanassa sikkhetha, ",
  "snp3.11:40.2": "samaṇūpāsanassa ca; ",
  "snp3.11:40.3": "Ekattaṃ monamakkhātaṃ, ",
  "snp3.11:40.4": "eko ce abhiramissasi; ",
  "snp3.11:40.5": "Atha bhāhisi dasadisā. ",
  "snp3.11:41.1": "724. ‘‘Sutvā dhīrānaṃ nigghosaṃ, ",
  "snp3.11:41.2": "jhāyīnaṃ kāmacāginaṃ; ",
  "snp3.11:41.3": "Tato hiriñca saddhañca, ",
  "snp3.11:41.4": "bhiyyo kubbetha māmako. ",
  "snp3.11:42.1": "725. ‘‘Taṃ nadīhi vijānātha, ",
  "snp3.11:42.2": "sobbhesu padaresu ca; ",
  "snp3.11:42.3": "Saṇantā yanti kusobbhā , ",
  "snp3.11:42.4": "tuṇhīyanti mahodadhī. ",
  "snp3.11:43.1": "726. ‘‘Yadūnakaṃ taṃ saṇati, ",
  "snp3.11:43.2": "yaṃ pūraṃ santameva taṃ; ",
  "snp3.11:43.3": "Aḍḍhakumbhūpamo bālo, ",
  "snp3.11:43.4": "rahado pūrova paṇḍito. ",
  "snp3.11:44.1": "727. ‘‘Yaṃ samaṇo bahuṃ bhāsati, ",
  "snp3.11:44.2": "upetaṃ atthasañhitaṃ; ",
  "snp3.11:44.3": "Jānaṃ so dhammaṃ deseti, ",
  "snp3.11:44.4": "jānaṃ so bahu bhāsati. ",
  "snp3.11:45.1": "728. ‘‘Yo ca jānaṃ saṃyatatto, ",
  "snp3.11:45.2": "jānaṃ na bahu bhāsati; ",
  "snp3.11:45.3": "Sa munī monamarahati, ",
  "snp3.11:45.4": "sa munī monamajjhagā’’ti. ",
  "snp3.11:45.5": "Nālakasuttaṃ ekādasamaṃ niṭṭhitaṃ. "
}
